==Alemannic German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|gsw|gmh|roup}}, from {{inh|gsw|goh|roub}}, from {{inh|gsw|gem-pro|*raubaz||rape, pillage; spoils; garment, robe}}, from {{der|gsw|ine-pro|*Hrewp-||to break, tear}}. Cognate with {{cog|de|Raub||robbery}}, {{cog|nl|roof||robbery}}, {{cog|en|reif||robbery}}. From the same {{der|gsw|ine-pro|-}} root as {{cog|la|rumpō||I break}}, {{cog|hi|लुप्त||disappeared, missing; extinct}}.

===Noun===
